+## [v0.1.29-test.1] - 2026-11-25
+
+> R42 — projected navigation source status candidate.
+
+### English
+- Distinguish a quiet source image from an explicitly detected input gap; wait for a post-gap decoded timestamp before reporting recovery.
+- Show a passive navigation-source card in available letterbox space, without shrinking the video or overlapping controls.
+- Retain the existing CarWith source, original touch geometry, dynamic pacing and theme; no independent navigation data is claimed.
+
+### 简体中文
+- 区分静止画面和已检测到的输入断流，等待断流后的解码时间戳再解除恢复状态。
+- 在可用留白区域显示导航源状态卡，不缩小视频或覆盖控制区。
+- 保留 CarWith 源、原触控坐标、动态调度及主题；不声称具备独立导航数据。
+
